%% Failed loadDocument sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant Stager as Staged load boundary
  participant Diagnostics as DiagnosticsHub
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Interaction as InteractionEngine
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Signals as Public signals

  Caller->>API: loadDocument(document)
  API->>API: reject disposed runtime before mutation

  alt runtime is disposed
    API--x Caller: throw StateError("CanvasRuntime is disposed.")
    Note over API,Signals: Rejection is a boundary failure; no runtime, store, cache, repaint, action, or listener effect is started.
  else runtime accepts public entry
    API->>Store: read current committed identity, selection, revisions, and id admission state
    Store-->>API: current committed state remains installed

    API->>Stager: validate public CanvasDocument
    Stager->>Stager: verify DTO invariants, limits, duplicate ids, resource references, and metadata

    alt public document validation fails
      Stager--x API: validation failure
    else runtime materialization fails
      API->>Stager: prepare full document replacement from DTO and current snapshot
      Stager->>Stager: materialize compact tables, resource descriptors, order, meta, and id generator floor
      Stager--x API: materialization failure
    end

    API->>Diagnostics: project load failure
    Diagnostics->>Diagnostics: sanitize path and bounded details
    Diagnostics-->>API: CanvasDataException or StateError
    API--x Caller: rethrow projected exception

    Note over API,Interaction: Active gesture is not interrupted; preview, pending line, pointer normalization, and pending tap history remain unchanged.
    Note over Store: Committed document identity, selection, controllerEpoch, and all document revisions remain unchanged.
    Note over Projection,Frame: Projection, spatial, resource, paint, static, text, path, stroke, and overlay caches remain unchanged.
    Note over Frame,Signals: No main repaint, overlay repaint, CanvasActionCommitted event, text edit event, public notify, or revision listener publication occurs.
  end

  Note over API,Store: Failure stops before PreparedDocumentLoad install; there is no atomic install, revision bump, cache invalidation action, or success-path interaction cleanup.
